{"repositoryId":885192468,"availability":"available","full":"llvm/eudsl","name":"eudsl","description":"Embedded Universal DSL: a good DSL for us, by us","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":84,"forks":17,"created":"2024-11-08T06:07:17Z","updated":"2026-10-17T14:57:57Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://llvm.github.io/eudsl/jupyter","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:28.341Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:28.341Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:28.341Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T07:38:22.555Z","stars":82,"forks":16},{"at":"2026-10-15T17:01:41.461Z","stars":82,"forks":16},{"at":"2026-10-17T16:01:28.341Z","stars":84,"forks":17}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository contains the source code for EUDSL, a toolkit for the construction of embedded DSLs, in arbitrary languages, for targeting MLIR.","FYI: this project is currently \"alpha\" quality.","where EUDSLPYTHONEXTRASHOSTPACKAGEPREFIX is (as it says) the package prefix for your chosen host bindings. When in doubt about this prefix, it is everything up until ir when you import your bindings, e.g., in import torchmlir.ir, torchmlir is the EUDSLPYTHONEXTRASHOSTPACKAGEPREFIX for the torch-mlir bindings."],"features":["eudsl-tblgen: Python bindings to LLVM's TableGen library;","eudsl-nbgen: A source-to-source translator that translates MLIR headers[^1] into direct nanobind bindings;","mlir-python-bindings: Scripts/CMake for nightly builds of the upstream MLIR Python bindings;","eudsl-python-extras: Extra utilities for the upstream MLIR Python bindings;","In reality, this package is meant to work in concert with any set of \"host bindings\" (some distribution of the actual MLIR Python bindings)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/llvm/eudsl/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b56c521414488346af213d73ca8a0bde8e3bc8a7cb1fa1c0a750649377d681fb","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T